453 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 270 0 R/E(During the endgame, our strategy focuses on efficiently scoring two samples before executing a level two ascent to maximize points. By ensuring a smooth transition between scoring and climbing, we optimize our endgame performance while maintaining stability and reliability in our final actions.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

454 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 270 0 R/T(After extensive research and testing, we determined that each cycle of collecting and depositing a sample into the high basket takes approximately 9 seconds. Based on these calculations, we estimate that we can score up to 13 samples during the tele-op period, yielding a total of 104 points. By refining our intake and outtake mechanisms, we aim to improve consistency, reduce cycle time, and maximize our scoring efficiency throughout the match.)/E(After extensive research and testing, we determined that each cycle of collecting and depositing a sample into the high basket takes approximately 9 seconds. Based on these calculations, we estimate that we can score up to 13 samples during the tele-op period, yielding a total of 104 points. By refining our intake and outtake mechanisms, we aim to improve consistency, reduce cycle time, and maximize our scoring efficiency throughout the match.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

455 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 270 0 R/T(Overall Strategy:)/E(Overall Strategy:)/Pg 14 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

456 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 270 0 R/T(Based on our analysis, we prioritized sample-based scoring for its efficiency and higher point potential. However, if our alliance partners excel at sample scoring, we can switch to specimen-based scoring as needed. In autonomous, we focus on specimens since the observation zone is closer to the submersible than the basket, ensuring a more consistent strategy. This approach maximizes adaptability and scoring potential while helping us contribute to victory.)/E(Based on our analysis, we prioritized sample-based scoring for its efficiency and higher point potential. However, if our alliance partners excel at sample scoring, we can switch to specimen-based scoring as needed. In autonomous, we focus on specimens since the observation zone is closer to the submersible than the basket, ensuring a more consistent strategy. This approach maximizes adaptability and scoring potential while helping us contribute to victory.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

457 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 270 0 R/T(Through additional calculations, we also determined that the process of collecting a sample, delivering it to the human player, converting it into a specimen, and depositing it onto the high rung takes approximately 15 seconds. This estimation allows us to score around eight specimens during the tele-op period, resulting in a total of 80 points. By optimizing efficiency and minimizing cycle times, we aim to maximize our scoring potential throughout the match.)/E(Through additional calculations, we also determined that the process of collecting a sample, delivering it to the human player, converting it into a specimen, and depositing it onto the high rung takes approximately 15 seconds. This estimation allows us to score around eight specimens during the tele-op period, resulting in a total of 80 points. By optimizing efficiency and minimizing cycle times, we aim to maximize our scoring potential throughout the match.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

