487 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 271 0 R/T(Our intake uses an active system to pull in samples quickly, reducing the need for precise driver control. This allows for faster and more consistent collection, keeping the robot efficient during matches. The design prioritizes speed and reliability, ensuring smooth operation without jams or delays. With a quick and controlled intake, we maximize performance and maintain a competitive edge.)/E(Our intake uses an active system to pull in samples quickly, reducing the need for precise driver control. This allows for faster and more consistent collection, keeping the robot efficient during matches. The design prioritizes speed and reliability, ensuring smooth operation without jams or delays. With a quick and controlled intake, we maximize performance and maintain a competitive edge.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

488 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 271 0 R/T(Outtake:)/E(Outtake:)/Pg 15 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

489 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 271 0 R/T(Our outtake seamlessly collects samples from the intake, ensuring a smooth transfer for scoring. With two degrees of freedom, it can adjust its position to deposit specimens accurately in different locations. Vertical slides allow it to extend and reach high-scoring areas with ease. This adaptability ensures efficient and consistent performance throughout the match.)/E(Our outtake seamlessly collects samples from the intake, ensuring a smooth transfer for scoring. With two degrees of freedom, it can adjust its position to deposit specimens accurately in different locations. Vertical slides allow it to extend and reach high-scoring areas with ease. This adaptability ensures efficient and consistent performance throughout the match.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

