519 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 272 0 R/T(The drivetrain features a parallel plate design, with motors placed at the center of the robot to ensure balanced weight distribution. These motors are positioned as low as possible to the ground, lowering the center of gravity, which significantly improves stability and reduces the chance of tipping during movement. Moreover, the motors are located opposite the vertical slides to create a counterbalancing effect. This arrangement helps maintain the robot's balance even when the vertical slides are fully extended, ensuring that the robot remains steady and reliable throughout various tasks on the field.)/E(The drivetrain features a parallel plate design, with motors placed at the center of the robot to ensure balanced weight distribution. These motors are positioned as low as possible to the ground, lowering the center of gravity, which significantly improves stability and reduces the chance of tipping during movement. Moreover, the motors are located opposite the vertical slides to create a counterbalancing effect. This arrangement helps maintain the robot's balance even when the vertical slides are fully extended, ensuring that the robot remains steady and reliable throughout various tasks on the field.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

520 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 272 0 R/T(CSK Develop3rs)/E(CSK Develop3rs)/Pg 16 0 R/K[7]>>
