endobj

524 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 272 0 R/T(Additionally, the drivetrain\220s structure is built for efficiency, offering smoother movements and better control during high-speed maneuvers or complex tasks. To sum it up, our drivetrain is a grand part of our robot, and could not advance our robot without its design and functionality.)/E(Additionally, the drivetrain\220s structure is built for efficiency, offering smoother movements and better control during high-speed maneuvers or complex tasks. To sum it up, our drivetrain is a grand part of our robot, and could not advance our robot without its design and functionality.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[11]>>
