590 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 276 0 R/E(The robot\220s control system is powered by sophisticated programming that boosts its efficiency. It processes sensor data in real-time, allowing for immediate adjustments during both autonomous and teleoperated phases. The system features an array of sensors to improve motor movement precision, and sensor fusion enhances the robot\220s ability to navigate more effectively. Color sensors also support intake and outtake functions, ensuring smooth handling of game pieces. The robot undergoes continuous testing and refinement to ensure consistent, reliable performance during competitions, enabling it to adapt to various challenges on the field.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

591 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 276 0 R/T(CSK Develop3rs)/E(CSK Develop3rs)/Pg 20 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

592 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 276 0 R/T(Page 11)/E(Page 11)/Pg 20 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

593 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 276 0 R/E(Our program includes different classes for controlling motors, sensors, and actuators, as well as for autonomous routines. Each class is structured to handle specific tasks, such as motor control, sensor reading, or navigation logic. This modular approach makes the code more organized and easier to modify or expand. Key classes interact with each other, ensuring smooth coordination and precise robot behavior.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

