612 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 277 0 R/E(This season, we have managed to attain approximately 210 outreach hours through collaborating with our community, which includes talking about STEM with our school peers and with current FLL and potentially future FTC members. We were also able to work with FIRST to help host an event to spread awareness about STEM at the Wings Over Camarillo Airshow. We got around 3000 viewers in attendance over the course of 2 days at this event.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

613 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 277 0 R/T(Sister Team Connection:)/E(Sister Team Connection:)/Pg 21 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

614 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 277 0 R/E(Starting this season, CSK has had two official FTC teams. We have worked together by sharing supplies and learning from each other in programming, design, and mechanics. Our collaboration has strengthened both teams and improved our overall performance. We also combined outreach efforts to spread awareness about STEM in our community, working together to introduce more people to robotics and inspire future engineers.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[19]>>
endobj

615 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 277 0 R/E(We recognize the value of mentorship and professional connections. Although we are just beginning this journey, we are seeking guidance from engineers, STEM educators, and professionals who can help us improve our skills and knowledge. Our goal is to build relationships that not only benefit our team but also inspire others to pursue careers in STEM fields. This allows ourselves and our community to have a relationship with one-another.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[20]>>
endobj

