638 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 278 0 R/T(The CSK foundation not only sponsors FTC teams but also two FLL \(First Lego League\) teams. One of the standout teams under CSK is the Robot3rs, which is mentored by a few members from our team. This past season, they recently achieved an impressive victory by winning their regional competition and earning a spot at the state championships. The Robot3rs will soon aspire to join FTC which will keep the CSK Foundation involved with FIRST for a long time.  )/E(The CSK foundation not only sponsors FTC teams but also two FLL \(First Lego League\) teams. One of the standout teams under CSK is the Robot3rs, which is mentored by a few members from our team. This past season, they recently achieved an impressive victory by winning their regional competition and earning a spot at the state championships. The Robot3rs will soon aspire to join FTC which will keep the CSK Foundation involved with FIRST for a long time.  )/Pg 22 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

639 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 278 0 R/T(Main Outreach Goal:)/E(Main Outreach Goal:)/Pg 22 0 R/K[12]>>
