640 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 278 0 R/T(During our many outreach events, one of our main goals was to spread STEM and FIRST everywhere we went. Some ways we did these was by passing out flyers and demoing our robot to show how fun STEM can be.)/E(During our many outreach events, one of our main goals was to spread STEM and FIRST everywhere we went. Some ways we did these was by passing out flyers and demoing our robot to show how fun STEM can be.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

