642 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 278 0 R/T(The second FLL team under the CSK Foundation are the CSK Challeng3rs, which are also mentored by various members of our FTC  team. During the 2023-2024 FLL  season,  they won the regional competition for FLL and advanced to the state championships. The Challeng3rs have also shown vast amounts of success on the field. They also won the Innovation Award in the competition, which helped secure their place among the ranks of the FLL community.  )/E(The second FLL team under the CSK Foundation are the CSK Challeng3rs, which are also mentored by various members of our FTC  team. During the 2023-2024 FLL  season,  they won the regional competition for FLL and advanced to the state championships. The Challeng3rs have also shown vast amounts of success on the field. They also won the Innovation Award in the competition, which helped secure their place among the ranks of the FLL community.  )/Pg 22 0 R/K[15]>>
