<</Title(The CSK foundation not only sponsors FTC teams but also two FLL \(First Lego League\) teams. One of the standout teams under CSK is the Robot3rs, which is mentored by a few members from our team. This past season, they recently achieved an impressive victory by winning their regional competition and earning a spot at the state championships. The Robot3rs will soon aspire to join FTC which will keep the CSK Foundation involved with FIRST for a long time.)/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1149 0 R/Prev 1217 0 R/Next 1304 0 R>>
