1364 0 obj
<</Title(Our intake uses an active system to pull in samples quickly, reducing the need for precise driver control. This allows for faster and more consistent collection, keeping the robot efficient during matches. The design prioritizes speed and reliability, ensuring smooth operation without jams or delays. With a quick and controlled intake, we maximize performance and maintain a competitive edge.)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1343 0 R/Next 1385 0 R>>
endobj

