1383 0 obj
<</Title(Building the ORCA involved assembling components based on the CAD model. We used a variety of materials, from metal and plastic to advanced composites, ensuring durability and performance.)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1362 0 R/Next 1384 0 R>>
endobj

1384 0 obj
<</Title(Computer-Aided Design \(CAD\) is essential for creating precise digital models. This step ensures that parts fit together correctly and function as intended before manufacturing.)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1362 0 R/Prev 1383 0 R>>
endobj

1385 0 obj
<</Title(Our outtake seamlessly collects samples from the intake, ensuring a smooth transfer for scoring. With two degrees of freedom, it can adjust its position to deposit specimens accurately in different locations. Vertical slides allow it to extend and reach high-scoring areas with ease. This adaptability ensures efficient and consistent performance throughout the match.)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1343 0 R/Prev 1364 0 R/Next 1386 0 R>>
endobj

